{"id":"9-1-2","courseId":"9","chapterNumber":"1.2","title":"Brøkrekning","description":"Multiplikasjon og divisjon med brøkar, samt samansette uttrykk.","estimatedMinutes":55,"competenceGoals":["utvikle og bruke metodar for hovudrekning, overslagsrekning og skriftleg rekning"],"content":[{"id":"9-1-2-intro","type":"text","content":"## Repetisjon av brøkrekning\n\nEin brøk $\\frac{a}{b}$ representerer $a$ delt på $b$, der $a$ er teljaren og $b$ er nemnaren."},{"id":"9-1-2-def-1","type":"definition","title":"Reknereglar for brøkar","content":"**Addisjon/Subtraksjon:** Må ha lik nemnar\n$$\\frac{a}{c} + \\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{a+b}{c}$$\n\n**Multiplikasjon:** Gang teljar med teljar, nemnar med nemnar\n$$\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a \\cdot c}{b \\cdot d}$$\n\n**Divisjon:** Gang med den omvende brøken\n$$\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$$"},{"id":"9-1-2-example-1","type":"example","title":"Døme 1","problem":"Rekn ut og forkort:\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4}$\nb) $\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{9}{8}$\nc) $\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{10}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 5}{3 \\cdot 4} = \\frac{10}{12} = \\frac{5}{6}$\n\nb) $\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{9}{8} = \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{8}{9} = \\frac{24}{36} = \\frac{2}{3}$\n\nc) $\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{5 \\cdot 3}{6 \\cdot 10} = \\frac{15}{60} = \\frac{1}{4}$"},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rekn ut og forkort","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{5} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{15} = \\frac{2}{5}$","answer":0.4},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4}{7} \\cdot \\frac{14}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{56}{56} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\div \\frac{5}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{5} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2}{9} \\div \\frac{4}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{9} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{1}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"1/6"}],"solution":"a) 2/5, b) 1, c) 1/2, d) 1/6","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-finnfeil","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-finnfeil-ex","number":"F1","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"**Finn feilen!** Ola har rekna ut $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{5}$ slik:\n\n$\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{2 + 1}{3 + 5} = \\frac{3}{8}$\n\nFinn feilen og skriv rett utrekning.","solution":"Ola har lagt saman teljar og nemnar kvar for seg, men det er feil. Vi kan berre leggje saman brøkar som har lik nemnar. Rett: Fellesnemnar er 15. $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 5}{3 \\cdot 5} + \\frac{1 \\cdot 3}{5 \\cdot 3} = \\frac{10}{15} + \\frac{3}{15} = \\frac{13}{15}$.","hints":["Vi kan berre leggje saman brøkar med lik nemnar — finn fellesnemnaren først"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-example-2","type":"example","title":"Døme 2","problem":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{4}$\nb) $\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{9}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) Fellesnemnar: 12\n   $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{8}{12} + \\frac{3}{12} = \\frac{11}{12}$\n\nb) Fellesnemnar: 18\n   $\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{9} = \\frac{15}{18} - \\frac{4}{18} = \\frac{11}{18}$"},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-2","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{15}{20} + \\frac{8}{20} = \\frac{23}{20}$","answer":1.15},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{7}{8} - \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{21}{24} - \\frac{8}{24} = \\frac{13}{24}$","expressionAnswer":"13/24"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{6} + \\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{3}{6} = 1$","answer":1}],"solution":"a) 23/20, b) 13/24, c) 1","hints":["Finn fellesnemnar først"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-text-3","type":"text","content":"## Samansette brøkuttrykk\n\nNår vi har brøkar i teljar eller nemnar, løyser vi opp ved å gange teljar og nemnar med same tal (ofte fellesnemnaren)."},{"id":"9-1-2-example-3","type":"example","title":"Døme 3","problem":"Forenkle:\n\na) $\\frac{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3}}{\\frac{1}{6}}$\n\nb) $\\frac{2}{\\frac{3}{4}}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) Først: $\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{5}{6}$\n\n   Så: $\\frac{\\frac{5}{6}}{\\frac{1}{6}} = \\frac{5}{6} \\div \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{6}{1} = 5$\n\nb) $\\frac{2}{\\frac{3}{4}} = 2 \\div \\frac{3}{4} = 2 \\cdot \\frac{4}{3} = \\frac{8}{3}$"},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-3","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Forenkle","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{2}{3}}{\\frac{4}{9}}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{9}{4} = \\frac{3}{2}$","answer":1.5},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{\\frac{6}{5}}$","solution":"$3 \\cdot \\frac{5}{6} = \\frac{5}{2}$","answer":2.5},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4}}{\\frac{3}{4}}$","solution":"$\\frac{\\frac{3}{4}}{\\frac{3}{4}} = 1$","answer":1}],"solution":"a) 3/2, b) 5/2, c) 1","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-example-4","type":"example","title":"Døme 4","problem":"I ein klasse er $\\frac{2}{5}$ av elevane gutar. $\\frac{3}{4}$ av gutane spelar fotball. Kor stor del av klassen er gutar som spelar fotball?","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\nDel = $\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{6}{20} = \\frac{3}{10}$\n\n$\\frac{3}{10}$ av klassen er gutar som spelar fotball."},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-4","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løys tekstoppgåvene","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{4}$ av ein pizza blir eten. Deretter blir $\\frac{2}{3}$ av det som er att eten. Kor mykje er att no?","solution":"Att først: $\\frac{1}{4}$. Eten: $\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{1}{6}$. Att: $\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{1}{12}$","expressionAnswer":"1/12"},{"label":"b","task":"Ein tank er $\\frac{2}{3}$ full. Etter påfylling er han $\\frac{5}{6}$ full. Kor mykje vart fylt på?","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{4}{6} = \\frac{1}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"1/6"}],"solution":"a) 1/12, b) 1/6","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-5","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Multipliser brøkane og forkort","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{7} \\cdot \\frac{7}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{14}{28} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{8} \\cdot \\frac{4}{15}$","solution":"$\\frac{20}{120} = \\frac{1}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"1/6"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{9}{10} \\cdot \\frac{5}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{45}{60} = \\frac{3}{4}$","answer":0.75},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{8} \\cdot \\frac{16}{9}$","solution":"$\\frac{48}{72} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"}],"solution":"a) 1/2, b) 1/6, c) 3/4, d) 2/3","hints":["Forkort før du gangar for enklare rekning"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-6","number":"6","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Divider brøkane og forkort","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{5} \\div \\frac{6}{7}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{5} \\cdot \\frac{7}{6} = \\frac{21}{30} = \\frac{7}{10}$","answer":0.7},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{8}{9} \\div \\frac{4}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{8}{9} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{24}{36} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{12} \\div \\frac{10}{9}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{12} \\cdot \\frac{9}{10} = \\frac{45}{120} = \\frac{3}{8}$","answer":0.375},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{7}{8} \\div \\frac{21}{16}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{8} \\cdot \\frac{16}{21} = \\frac{112}{168} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"}],"solution":"a) 7/10, b) 2/3, c) 3/8, d) 2/3","hints":["Hugs: Divider = gang med omvend brøk"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Finn fellesnemnar og rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{8} - \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{8} - \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{3}{8}$","answer":0.375},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{5} + \\frac{3}{10}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{10} + \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{7}{10}$","answer":0.7},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{7}{12} - \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{12} - \\frac{4}{12} = \\frac{3}{12} = \\frac{1}{4}$","answer":0.25}],"solution":"a) 1/2, b) 3/8, c) 7/10, d) 1/4","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-8","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-8","number":"8","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut med fleire brøkar","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{2}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{6}{6} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{8} - \\frac{4}{8} + \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{3}{8}$","answer":0.375},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} + \\frac{2}{3} - \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} + \\frac{4}{6} - \\frac{3}{6} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"d","task":"$1 - \\frac{2}{5} - \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{20}{20} - \\frac{8}{20} - \\frac{5}{20} = \\frac{7}{20}$","answer":0.35}],"solution":"a) 1, b) 3/8, c) 1, d) 7/20","hints":["Finn minste felles nemnar først"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-9","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-9","number":"9","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Forenkle dei samansette brøkuttrykka","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{3}{4}}{\\frac{9}{8}}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{8}{9} = \\frac{24}{36} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{7}{6}}$","solution":"$\\frac{\\frac{7}{6}}{\\frac{7}{6}} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{\\frac{10}{3}}$","solution":"$5 \\cdot \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{15}{10} = \\frac{3}{2}$","answer":1.5},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{4}}{\\frac{3}{8}}$","solution":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}}{\\frac{3}{8}} = \\frac{1}{4} \\cdot \\frac{8}{3} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"}],"solution":"a) 2/3, b) 1, c) 3/2, d) 2/3","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-10","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-10","number":"10","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Tekstoppgåver med brøkar","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Kari har lese $\\frac{2}{5}$ av ei bok som har 350 sider. Kor mange sider har ho lese?","solution":"$\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot 350 = \\frac{700}{5} = 140$ sider","answer":140},{"label":"b","task":"Ole brukte $\\frac{3}{4}$ time på mattelekser og $\\frac{1}{2}$ time på norsk. Kor lang tid brukte han totalt?","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{2}{4} = \\frac{5}{4} = 1\\frac{1}{4}$ time"},{"label":"c","task":"Ein pose inneheld 24 kuler. $\\frac{1}{3}$ er raude og $\\frac{1}{4}$ er blå. Kor mange kuler er korkje raude eller blå?","solution":"Raude: $8$, Blå: $6$. Resten: $24 - 8 - 6 = 10$ kuler","answer":10}],"solution":"a) 140 sider, b) 1 1/4 time, c) 10 kuler","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-11","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-11","number":"11","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Kombinerte oppgåver","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{2} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{4}{6} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"},{"label":"c","task":"$(\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3}) \\cdot \\frac{6}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{6}{5} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\div (\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4})$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{3}{4} = 1$","answer":1}],"solution":"a) 1, b) 2/3, c) 1, d) 1","hints":["Følg rekkjefølgja: parentesar, gange/dele, pluss/minus"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-12","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-12","number":"12","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Utfordringsoppgåver","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Finn $x$ når $\\frac{x}{3} = \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$x = \\frac{2}{5} \\cdot 3 = \\frac{6}{5}$","answer":1.2},{"label":"b","task":"Finn $x$ når $\\frac{3}{x} = \\frac{9}{12}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{x} = \\frac{3}{4}$, så $x = 4$","answer":4},{"label":"c","task":"Kva for brøk ligg midt mellom $\\frac{1}{4}$ og $\\frac{1}{2}$?","solution":"Gjennomsnitt: $\\frac{\\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{2}}{2} = \\frac{\\frac{3}{4}}{2} = \\frac{3}{8}$","answer":0.375},{"label":"d","task":"Forenkle $\\frac{1}{1 + \\frac{1}{2}}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{\\frac{3}{2}} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"}],"solution":"a) 6/5, b) 4, c) 3/8, d) 2/3","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-drofting","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-drofting-ex","number":"D1","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"**Drøftingsoppgåve:** Ein pizza blir delt i 8 like stykke. Ali et $\\frac{3}{8}$ av pizzaen, og Bea et $\\frac{1}{4}$ av pizzaen. Ali seier at han åt meir enn dobbelt så mykje som Bea. Har Ali rett? Grunngi svaret med brøkrekning. Kor mykje av pizzaen er att?","solution":"Bea åt $\\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{2}{8}$. Ali åt $\\frac{3}{8}$. Dobbelt av Beas del: $2 \\cdot \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{4}{8}$. Sidan $\\frac{3}{8} < \\frac{4}{8}$, åt Ali IKKJE meir enn dobbelt så mykje. Han åt $\\frac{3}{8} \\div \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{3}{2} = 1{,}5$ gonger så mykje, altså halvannan gong så mykje. Til saman åt dei $\\frac{3}{8} + \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{5}{8}$. Det er $1 - \\frac{5}{8} = \\frac{3}{8}$ att.","hints":["Gjer om $\\frac{1}{4}$ til åttedelar for å samanlikne"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Multiplikasjon av brøkar**: Gang teljar med teljar og nemnar med nemnar: $\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{ac}{bd}$\n- **Divisjon av brøkar**: Gang med den omvende brøken: $\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$\n- **Addisjon og subtraksjon av brøkar**: Finn fellesnemnar først, deretter adder eller subtraher teljarane\n- **Samansette brøkuttrykk**: Løys opp ved å rekne ut teljar og nemnar separat, og divider deretter\n- **Rekkjefølgje med brøkar**: Parentesar, potensar, multiplikasjon/divisjon, addisjon/subtraksjon\n\n### Nøkkelomgrep\n| Omgrep | Forklaring |\n|--------|------------|\n| Teljar | Talet over brøkstreken |\n| Nemnar | Talet under brøkstreken |\n| Fellesnemnar | Felles multiplum av nemnarane, nødvendig for addisjon/subtraksjon |\n| Omvend brøk | Brøken snudd opp ned, blir brukt ved divisjon |\n| Forkorting | Dele teljar og nemnar på felles faktor |\n| Samansett brøk | Brøk der teljar eller nemnar også inneheld brøkar |\n\n### Viktige formlar\n- $\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{ac}{bd}$\n- $\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$\n- $\\frac{a}{c} + \\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{a+b}{c}$"},{"id":"9-1-2-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgåver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgåver","content":[{"id":"9-1-2-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Multipliser brøkar.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{4}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{8}{15}$","expressionAnswer":"8/15"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{7} \\cdot \\frac{2}{9}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{63} = \\frac{2}{21}$","expressionAnswer":"2/21"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{10}$","solution":"$\\frac{15}{60} = \\frac{1}{4}$","answer":0.25},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{4}{9} \\cdot \\frac{3}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{12}{72} = \\frac{1}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"1/6"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{7}{4} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{14}{12} = \\frac{7}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"7/6"},{"label":"f","task":"$3 \\cdot \\frac{5}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{15}{8}$","answer":1.875}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{8}{15}$, b) $\\frac{2}{21}$, c) $\\frac{1}{4}$, d) $\\frac{1}{6}$, e) $\\frac{7}{6}$, f) $\\frac{15}{8}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Gang teljar med teljar og nemnar med nemnar: $\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{ac}{bd}$"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Divider brøkar.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{2}{1} = \\frac{6}{4} = \\frac{3}{2}$","answer":1.5},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\div \\frac{5}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{5} = \\frac{15}{30} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\div \\frac{4}{9}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{9}{4} = \\frac{18}{12} = \\frac{3}{2}$","answer":1.5},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{7}{8} \\div \\frac{7}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{8} \\cdot \\frac{4}{7} = \\frac{28}{56} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"e","task":"$4 \\div \\frac{2}{3}$","solution":"$4 \\cdot \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{12}{2} = 6$","answer":6},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{9}{10} \\div 3$","solution":"$\\frac{9}{10} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{9}{30} = \\frac{3}{10}$","answer":0.3}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{2}$, b) $\\frac{1}{2}$, c) $\\frac{3}{2}$, d) $\\frac{1}{2}$, e) $6$, f) $\\frac{3}{10}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Divisjon med brøk = multiplikasjon med den omvende brøken: $\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Adder og subtraher brøkar.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{5} + \\frac{1}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{5}$","answer":0.6},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{4} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{8}{12} + \\frac{9}{12} = \\frac{17}{12}$","expressionAnswer":"17/12"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{7}{8} - \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{8} - \\frac{6}{8} = \\frac{1}{8}$","answer":0.125}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{5}$, b) $\\frac{1}{2}$, c) $\\frac{1}{2}$, d) $\\frac{17}{12}$, e) $\\frac{1}{2}$, f) $\\frac{1}{8}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Finn fellesnemnar før du adderer eller subtraherer teljarane"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Samansette brøkuttrykk.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Rekn ut $\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{3}{12} = \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{3}{4}$","answer":0.75},{"label":"b","task":"Rekn ut $\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4})$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{6}{12} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"c","task":"Rekn ut $\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"d","task":"Rekn ut $(\\frac{3}{4})^2$","solution":"$\\frac{9}{16}$","answer":0.5625},{"label":"e","task":"Rekn ut $\\frac{\\frac{2}{3}}{\\frac{4}{5}}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4} = \\frac{10}{12} = \\frac{5}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"5/6"},{"label":"f","task":"Rekn ut $\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{2}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{6}{6} = 1$","answer":1}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{4}$, b) $\\frac{1}{2}$, c) $\\frac{1}{2}$, d) $\\frac{9}{16}$, e) $\\frac{5}{6}$, f) $1$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Hugs rekkjefølgja: potens, multiplikasjon/divisjon, addisjon/subtraksjon"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-rep-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-rep-ex-5","number":"R5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Brøkrekning med variablar og praktiske oppgåver.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Forenkle $\\frac{2x}{3} \\cdot \\frac{9}{4x}$ (for $x \\neq 0$)","solution":"$\\frac{18x}{12x} = \\frac{3}{2}$","answer":1.5},{"label":"b","task":"Forenkle $\\frac{x}{4} + \\frac{x}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{3x}{12} + \\frac{2x}{12} = \\frac{5x}{12}$","expressionAnswer":"(5x)/(12)"},{"label":"c","task":"Ei kake blir delt i 8 bitar. Marte et $\\frac{3}{8}$ og Nils et $\\frac{1}{4}$. Kor mykje er att?","solution":"Eten: $\\frac{3}{8} + \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{5}{8}$. Att: $1 - \\frac{5}{8} = \\frac{3}{8}$","answer":0.375},{"label":"d","task":"Eit oppdrag tek $\\frac{2}{3}$ time for éin person. To personar deler jobben likt. Kor lang tid bruker dei?","solution":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\div 2 = \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{3}$ time = 20 min","expressionAnswer":"1/3"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{2}$, b) $\\frac{5x}{12}$, c) $\\frac{3}{8}$, d) $\\frac{1}{3}$ time","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Forkort like faktorar i teljar og nemnar. For tekstoppgåver: set opp brøkuttrykket først."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-rep-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-rep-ex-6","number":"R6","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Krevjande brøkoppgåver.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Forenkle $\\frac{1}{1 - \\frac{1}{3}}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\frac{3}{2}$","answer":1.5},{"label":"b","task":"Forenkle $\\frac{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3}}{\\frac{1}{4}}$","solution":"$\\frac{\\frac{5}{6}}{\\frac{1}{4}} = \\frac{5}{6} \\cdot 4 = \\frac{20}{6} = \\frac{10}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"10/3"},{"label":"c","task":"Finn $x$ når $\\frac{x}{x+2} = \\frac{3}{5}$ (for $x \\neq -2$)","solution":"$5x = 3(x+2) \\Rightarrow 5x = 3x + 6 \\Rightarrow 2x = 6 \\Rightarrow x = 3$"},{"label":"d","task":"Vis at $\\frac{1}{n} - \\frac{1}{n+1} = \\frac{1}{n(n+1)}$ for alle $n \\neq 0$.","solution":"$\\frac{1}{n} - \\frac{1}{n+1} = \\frac{n+1 - n}{n(n+1)} = \\frac{1}{n(n+1)}$ ✓","expressionAnswer":"(1)/(n(n+1))"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{2}$, b) $\\frac{10}{3}$, c) $x = 3$, d) Sjå bevis","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["For samansette brøkar: rekn ut teljar og nemnar separat, og divider deretter"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}],"exercises":[],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"cbed09f68cd8809b","translatedAt":"2026-06-17T01:58:55.113Z","model":"claude-code-agent","strings":225,"tm":{"b9f2f3b92735cf06":"Brøkrekning","cf41de16c741c688":"Multiplikasjon og divisjon med brøkar, samt samansette uttrykk.","f0588999dab3c379":"utvikle og bruke metodar for hovudrekning, overslagsrekning og skriftleg rekning","0ebfcb545d5750cc":"## Repetisjon av brøkrekning\n\nEin brøk $\\frac{a}{b}$ representerer $a$ delt på $b$, der $a$ er teljaren og $b$ er nemnaren.","b6f7ec03980a8b46":"Reknereglar for brøkar","860ea0ec447822fe":"**Addisjon/Subtraksjon:** Må ha lik nemnar\n$$\\frac{a}{c} + \\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{a+b}{c}$$\n\n**Multiplikasjon:** Gang teljar med teljar, nemnar med nemnar\n$$\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a \\cdot c}{b \\cdot d}$$\n\n**Divisjon:** Gang med den omvende brøken\n$$\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$$","58916c7752f6e6c9":"Døme 1","dff312c64d22830e":"Rekn ut og forkort:\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4}$\nb) $\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{9}{8}$\nc) $\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{10}$","1a1c3ce7b085fb0e":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 5}{3 \\cdot 4} = \\frac{10}{12} = \\frac{5}{6}$\n\nb) $\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{9}{8} = \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{8}{9} = \\frac{24}{36} = \\frac{2}{3}$\n\nc) $\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{5 \\cdot 3}{6 \\cdot 10} = \\frac{15}{60} = \\frac{1}{4}$","a620616edb91c14b":"Rekn ut og forkort","3227427a2de3be2a":"$\\frac{3}{5} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}$","e96ca1eb02defaf5":"$\\frac{6}{15} = \\frac{2}{5}$","126fea9b48621845":"$\\frac{4}{7} \\cdot \\frac{14}{8}$","cdac0dbc59054a6c":"$\\frac{56}{56} = 1$","a1cacc7b8de1553d":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\div \\frac{5}{3}$","925c63ac0d7ef032":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{5} = \\frac{1}{2}$","36797185f17848e9":"$\\frac{2}{9} \\div \\frac{4}{3}$","fe81d4a932fb5368":"$\\frac{2}{9} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{1}{6}$","c1e27f63d5ad847d":"a) 2/5, b) 1, c) 1/2, d) 1/6","8e2764053c9d60e1":"**Finn feilen!** Ola har rekna ut $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{5}$ slik:\n\n$\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{2 + 1}{3 + 5} = \\frac{3}{8}$\n\nFinn feilen og skriv rett utrekning.","c80234b9afbb4274":"Ola har lagt saman teljar og nemnar kvar for seg, men det er feil. Vi kan berre leggje saman brøkar som har lik nemnar. Rett: Fellesnemnar er 15. $\\frac{2}{3} +